      "purpose": "DRAFT (mock, grounded on 8 retrieved chunks):\n- Decision: The acquisition subsystem shall use a time-tagged sample buffer for all channels. Decision: The REST interface in REQ-0005 shall be versioned from day one.  [source: MoM_DesignReview04.docx / 1. Decisions]\n- Action item: Update SysRS section 2 to clarify the REQ-0001 sampling rate. Owner: Dr. Sharma. Due: 2026-09-01. Action item: Confirm REQ-0008 authentication mechanism with the security panel. Owner: Lt. Rao. Due: 2026-09-15.  [source: MoM_DesignReview04.docx / 2. Action Items]\n- Requirement change: REQ-0006 is modified to require structured JSON logging output. Requirement change: A new requirement REQ-0011 is added to require automatic fault recovery within 30 seconds, in addition to REQ-0009.  [source: MoM_DesignReview04.docx / 3. Requirement Changes]\n- REQ-0001: PASS \u2014 all 3 channels acquired during the hardware-in-loop demonstration. REQ-0005: FAIL \u2014 sample retrieval endpoint did not meet latency budget during load test. REQ-0002: PASS \u2014 MTBF estimate recorded above 2000 hours on the reference platform.  [source: MoM_DesignReview04.docx / 4. Test Outcomes]\n- ional Requirements  [source: SRS.generated / 1 Introduction]",
